  "name": "Green Salad with Cranberry Vinaigrette",
  "subtitle": "Crisp greens with tart cranberry dressing",
  "description": "Toasted almonds, red onion, and blue cheese add contrast to fresh greens tossed in a smooth cranberry vinaigrette.",
